<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES-.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES-.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Designer Holdings Ltd and Unisource Worldwide Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Corimon SACA and Grupo Sidek SA.</p>
